  message: "Dogfood re-confirmation, broader scope. Container/type-declaration kinds lack stable_id across tree-sitter analyzers: 26 real-language structural-kind nodes carry NULL stable_id across csharp/go/java/rust/solidity/swift/typescript/wgsl (csharp class/enum/struct, go method/struct, java class/enum, rust enum/struct/trait, solidity constructor/contract/event/function x2/modifier, swift class/enum/protocol, typescript class x4/enum, wgsl struct x2). ALL 4 TypeScript class nodes have NULL stable_id (0/4), 3 of them real production components at packages/htrac-frontend/src/components/*.ts. For csharp class/struct/enum, BOTH stable_id and shape_id are NULL. The §6 cross-version interface-identity handle is never produced for these declarations. Reproduced on fresh /tmp runs."  # 48ad
